  var MORE = {"es":{"A flight school simulator, not a computer game":"Un simulador de escuela de vuelo, no un juego de ordenador","The machines on this site are professional Cessna 172 and Cessna 152 training devices for flight schools and aero clubs. They are not the PC game that uses a similar name. The student sits in a full-size cabin, holds a real yoke and looks at a wide visual system. The instructor starts the session from an iPad or iPhone. There is no separate desktop computer to boot and no external controller box to configure.":"Las máquinas de este sitio son dispositivos de entrenamiento profesionales Cessna 172 y Cessna 152 para escuelas de vuelo y aeroclubes. No son el juego de PC que usa un nombre similar. El estudiante se sienta en una cabina de tamaño completo, sostiene un yugo real y observa un amplio sistema visual. El instructor inicia la sesión desde un iPad o iPhone. No hay una computadora de escritorio separada para arrancar ni una caja de controlador externo para configurar.","A school uses the simulator for procedures, cockpit familiarisation, radio work and the first hours of handling, before the student burns fuel in the aircraft. The operating cost is about €3 per hour. There is no fuel, no engine time and no airframe wear. Schools that move a large share of early training into the simulator commonly save 30 to 92 percent against flying the same exercises in the real Cessna.":"Una escuela utiliza el simulador para procedimientos, familiarización con la cabina, trabajo por radio y las primeras horas de manejo, antes de que el alumno queme combustible en el avión. El coste de funcionamiento es de unos 3 € por hora. No hay combustible, ni tiempo de motor ni desgaste del fuselaje. Las escuelas que trasladan una gran parte del entrenamiento inicial al simulador comúnmente ahorran entre un 30 y un 92 por ciento al realizar los mismos ejercicios en el Cessna real.","What is included":"que esta incluido","A full-size Cessna 172 or 152 cabin, in Big or Mini size.":"Una cabina Cessna 172 o 152 de tamaño completo, en tamaño Big o Mini.","Fully automatic start: ready to fly in about 65 seconds.":"Arranque totalmente automático: listo para volar en unos 65 segundos.","Control from an iPad or iPhone, with no external controller.":"Control desde un iPad o iPhone, sin controlador externo.","Real primer, carburettor heat and fuses, not painted switches.":"Imprimación, calefacción de carburador y fusibles reales, interruptores no pintados.","A visual system sized for the model you choose.":"Un sistema visual dimensionado para el modelo que elijas.","Turnkey delivery, installation support and a usual lead time of 2 to 3 months.":"Entrega llave en mano, soporte de instalación y plazo de entrega habitual de 2 a 3 meses.","Two sizes and a clear price":"Dos tamaños y un precio claro","The Big models need about 5.2 × 4.62 metres. The Mini models fit in about 2.4 × 2.8 metres, which is a classroom or a corner of a hangar. Both lines exist as a simpler version and as a professional version. Purchase prices for the full-embedded professional units start at about €65,000 to €70,000. The ATC simulator, built for tower, approach and multi-sector training, is a separate system and starts at about €350,000. Cockpit parts, including the Magic Yoke, Garmin-style panels, a radio, a transponder and a compass, can be bought on their own if you are building a device yourself.":"Los modelos Big necesitan unos 5,2 × 4,62 metros. Los modelos Mini caben en aproximadamente 2,4 × 2,8 metros, lo que equivale a un aula o un rincón de un hangar. Ambas líneas existen como versión más sencilla y como versión profesional. Los precios de compra de las unidades profesionales totalmente integradas empiezan entre 65.000 y 70.000 euros. El simulador ATC, construido para entrenamiento en torre, aproximación y multisectorial, es un sistema independiente y cuesta alrededor de 350.000 euros. Las piezas de la cabina, incluido el Magic Yoke, paneles estilo Garmin, una radio, un transpondedor y una brújula, se pueden comprar por sí solas si usted mismo está construyendo un dispositivo.","Who it is built for":"¿Para quién está diseñado?","The main buyers are flight schools, aero clubs and training organisations that want more hours on the ground without losing the feel of a Cessna. Owners also use it as a private procedure trainer in a garage or a small hall. It runs in any weather, day or night, so the timetable does not stop for wind or for a grounded aircraft.":"Los principales compradores son escuelas de vuelo, aeroclubes y organizaciones de formación que quieren más horas en tierra sin perder la sensación de un Cessna. Los propietarios también lo utilizan como entrenador de procedimientos privado en un garaje o en una pequeña sala. Funciona en cualquier clima, de día o de noche, por lo que el horario no se detiene por el viento o por un avión en tierra.","We check the room, the power supply and the access path before the order. The unit is tested and then delivered. After installation we stay available for maintenance and remote support. If you already know the room size, write to info@virtualsky.gr with the model you prefer and the country of delivery.":"Comprobamos la habitación, el suministro eléctrico y el camino de acceso antes de realizar el pedido. La unidad se prueba y luego se entrega. Después de la instalación, permanecemos disponibles para mantenimiento y soporte remoto. Si ya conoces el tamaño de la habitación, escribe a info@virtualsky.gr con el modelo que prefieres y el país de entrega.","What the simulator replaces, and what it does not":"Qué reemplaza el simulador y qué no","Simulator time does not replace every hour required by the regulations. It does remove a large part of the cost and the risk from the early lessons. Work associated with the University of Illinois reports about 40 percent fewer errors in the first real flight hours after structured simulator training. European and US authorities both treat a flight simulation training device as a normal tool for pilot training, not as a toy. Use the official pages when you design a syllabus:":"El tiempo del simulador no reemplaza cada hora exigida por la normativa. Elimina gran parte del costo y el riesgo de las primeras lecciones. Un trabajo asociado con la Universidad de Illinois informa alrededor de un 40 por ciento menos de errores en las primeras horas de vuelo reales después del entrenamiento estructurado en simulador. Tanto las autoridades europeas como las estadounidenses tratan un dispositivo de entrenamiento de simulación de vuelo como una herramienta normal para el entrenamiento de pilotos, no como un juguete. Utilice las páginas oficiales cuando diseñe un plan de estudios:","EASA: Flight Simulation Training Devices":"EASA: Dispositivos de entrenamiento de simulación de vuelo","FAA: National Simulator Program":"FAA: Programa Nacional de Simuladores","A quotation includes the chosen model, shipping to your country, installation and the first training for your instructors. You do not have to buy the parts separately: the full-embedded simulator is delivered as one machine.":"Una cotización incluye el modelo elegido, envío a su país, instalación y la primera capacitación para sus instructores. No es necesario comprar las piezas por separado: el simulador totalmente integrado se entrega como una sola máquina.","Tell us the model, the room and the number of students. We reply with a formal offer, the delivery window and what has to be ready on site.":"Indícanos el modelo, la sala y el número de alumnos. Respondemos con una oferta formal, el plazo de entrega y lo que debe estar listo en el sitio."},"fr":{"A flight school simulator, not a computer game":"Un simulateur d'école de pilotage, pas un jeu informatique","The machines on this site are professional Cessna 172 and Cessna 152 training devices for flight schools and aero clubs. They are not the PC game that uses a similar name. The student sits in a full-size cabin, holds a real yoke and looks at a wide visual system. The instructor starts the session from an iPad or iPhone. There is no separate desktop computer to boot and no external controller box to configure.":"Les machines présentes sur ce site sont des appareils de formation professionnels Cessna 172 et Cessna 152 destinés aux écoles de pilotage et aux aéroclubs. Ce n’est pas le jeu PC qui utilise un nom similaire. L'étudiant est assis dans une cabine grandeur nature, tient un véritable joug et regarde un large système visuel. Le formateur démarre la séance depuis un iPad ou un iPhone. Il n’y a pas d’ordinateur de bureau séparé à démarrer ni de boîtier de contrôleur externe à configurer.","A school uses the simulator for procedures, cockpit familiarisation, radio work and the first hours of handling, before the student burns fuel in the aircraft. The operating cost is about €3 per hour. There is no fuel, no engine time and no airframe wear. Schools that move a large share of early training into the simulator commonly save 30 to 92 percent against flying the same exercises in the real Cessna.":"Une école utilise le simulateur pour les procédures, la familiarisation au cockpit, le travail radio et les premières heures de manipulation, avant que l'élève ne brûle du carburant dans l'avion. Le coût de fonctionnement est d'environ 3 € par heure. Il n’y a pas de carburant, pas de temps moteur et pas d’usure de la cellule. Les écoles qui transfèrent une grande partie de la formation initiale sur le simulateur économisent généralement de 30 à 92 % en évitant de réaliser les mêmes exercices sur le vrai Cessna.","What is included":"Ce qui est inclus","A full-size Cessna 172 or 152 cabin, in Big or Mini size.":"Une cabine Cessna 172 ou 152 pleine grandeur, en taille Big ou Mini.","Fully automatic start: ready to fly in about 65 seconds.":"Démarrage entièrement automatique : prêt à voler en 65 secondes environ.","Control from an iPad or iPhone, with no external controller.":"Contrôlez depuis un iPad ou un iPhone, sans contrôleur externe.","Real primer, carburettor heat and fuses, not painted switches.":"Véritable amorce, chauffage du carburateur et fusibles, interrupteurs non peints.","A visual system sized for the model you choose.":"Un système visuel dimensionné pour le modèle que vous choisissez.","Turnkey delivery, installation support and a usual lead time of 2 to 3 months.":"Livraison clé en main, accompagnement à l'installation et délai habituel de 2 à 3 mois.","Two sizes and a clear price":"Deux tailles et un prix clair","The Big models need about 5.2 × 4.62 metres. The Mini models fit in about 2.4 × 2.8 metres, which is a classroom or a corner of a hangar. Both lines exist as a simpler version and as a professional version. Purchase prices for the full-embedded professional units start at about €65,000 to €70,000. The ATC simulator, built for tower, approach and multi-sector training, is a separate system and starts at about €350,000. Cockpit parts, including the Magic Yoke, Garmin-style panels, a radio, a transponder and a compass, can be bought on their own if you are building a device yourself.":"Les modèles Big ont besoin d'environ 5,2 × 4,62 mètres. Les modèles Mini s'intègrent dans environ 2,4 × 2,8 mètres, ce qui correspond à une salle de classe ou à un coin d'un hangar. Les deux lignes existent en version plus simple et en version professionnelle. Les prix d'achat des unités professionnelles entièrement intégrées commencent entre 65 000 et 70 000 € environ. Le simulateur ATC, conçu pour la formation tour, approche et multisectorielle, est un système distinct et commence à environ 350 000 €. Les pièces du cockpit, notamment le Magic Yoke, les panneaux de style Garmin, une radio, un transpondeur et une boussole, peuvent être achetées seules si vous construisez vous-même un appareil.","Who it is built for":"Pour qui il est construit","The main buyers are flight schools, aero clubs and training organisations that want more hours on the ground without losing the feel of a Cessna. Owners also use it as a private procedure trainer in a garage or a small hall. It runs in any weather, day or night, so the timetable does not stop for wind or for a grounded aircraft.":"Les principaux acheteurs sont des écoles de pilotage, des aéroclubs et des organismes de formation qui souhaitent passer plus d'heures au sol sans perdre les sensations d'un Cessna. Les propriétaires l'utilisent également comme entraîneur de procédures privé dans un garage ou un petit hall. Il fonctionne par tous les temps, de jour comme de nuit, de sorte que l'horaire ne s'arrête pas en raison du vent ou d'un avion au sol.","We check the room, the power supply and the access path before the order. The unit is tested and then delivered. After installation we stay available for maintenance and remote support. If you already know the room size, write to info@virtualsky.gr with the model you prefer and the country of delivery.":"Nous vérifions la salle, l'alimentation électrique et le chemin d'accès avant la commande. L'unité est testée puis livrée. Après l'installation, nous restons disponibles pour la maintenance et l'assistance à distance. Si vous connaissez déjà la taille de la pièce, écrivez à info@virtualsky.gr avec le modèle que vous préférez et le pays de livraison.","What the simulator replaces, and what it does not":"Ce que le simulateur remplace et ce qu'il ne remplace pas","Simulator time does not replace every hour required by the regulations. It does remove a large part of the cost and the risk from the early lessons. Work associated with the University of Illinois reports about 40 percent fewer errors in the first real flight hours after structured simulator training. European and US authorities both treat a flight simulation training device as a normal tool for pilot training, not as a toy. Use the official pages when you design a syllabus:":"Le temps du simulateur ne remplace pas toutes les heures exigées par la réglementation. Cela supprime une grande partie des coûts et des risques liés aux premières leçons. Des travaux associés à l'Université de l'Illinois font état d'environ 40 % d'erreurs en moins au cours des premières heures de vol réelles après une formation structurée sur simulateur. Les autorités européennes et américaines considèrent toutes deux un appareil de simulation de vol comme un outil normal de formation des pilotes et non comme un jouet. Utilisez les pages officielles lorsque vous concevez un programme :","EASA: Flight Simulation Training Devices":"EASA : dispositifs de formation par simulation de vol","FAA: National Simulator Program":"FAA : Programme national de simulateurs","A quotation includes the chosen model, shipping to your country, installation and the first training for your instructors. You do not have to buy the parts separately: the full-embedded simulator is delivered as one machine.":"Un devis comprend le modèle choisi, l'expédition dans votre pays, l'installation et la première formation de vos instructeurs. Vous n'êtes pas obligé d'acheter les pièces séparément : le simulateur entièrement embarqué est livré en une seule machine.","Tell us the model, the room and the number of students. We reply with a formal offer, the delivery window and what has to be ready on site.":"Dites-nous le modèle, la salle et le nombre d'étudiants. Nous répondons avec une offre formelle, le délai de livraison et ce qui doit être prêt sur place."},"ru":{"A flight school simulator, not a computer game":"Симулятор летной школы, а не компьютерная игра","The machines on this site are professional Cessna 172 and Cessna 152 training devices for flight schools and aero clubs. They are not the PC game that uses a similar name. The student sits in a full-size cabin, holds a real yoke and looks at a wide visual system. The instructor starts the session from an iPad or iPhone. There is no separate desktop computer to boot and no external controller box to configure.":"Машины на этом сайте — это профессиональные тренажеры Cessna 172 и Cessna 152 для летных школ и аэроклубов. Это не игра для ПК с похожим названием. Студент сидит в полноразмерной кабине, держит настоящее штурвал и смотрит в широкую зрительную систему. Преподаватель начинает занятие с iPad или iPhone. Не требуется отдельного настольного компьютера для загрузки и внешнего контроллера для настройки.","A school uses the simulator for procedures, cockpit familiarisation, radio work and the first hours of handling, before the student burns fuel in the aircraft. The operating cost is about €3 per hour. There is no fuel, no engine time and no airframe wear. Schools that move a large share of early training into the simulator commonly save 30 to 92 percent against flying the same exercises in the real Cessna.":"Школа использует симулятор для процедур, ознакомления с кабиной, работы по радио и первых часов управления, прежде чем ученик сожжет топливо в самолете. Стоимость эксплуатации составляет около 3 евро в час. Нет топлива, нет времени работы двигателя и нет износа планера. Школы, которые переносят большую часть раннего обучения на симулятор, обычно экономят от 30 до 92 процентов по сравнению с выполнением тех же упражнений на настоящей Cessna.","What is included":"Что включено","A full-size Cessna 172 or 152 cabin, in Big or Mini size.":"Полноразмерная кабина Cessna 172 или 152 размера Big или Mini.","Fully automatic start: ready to fly in about 65 seconds.":"Полностью автоматический запуск: готовность к полету примерно через 65 секунд.","Control from an iPad or iPhone, with no external controller.":"Управление с iPad или iPhone без внешнего контроллера.","Real primer, carburettor heat and fuses, not painted switches.":"Настоящая грунтовка, обогрев карбюратора и предохранители, некрашеные переключатели.","A visual system sized for the model you choose.":"Визуальная система, размер которой соответствует выбранной вами модели.","Turnkey delivery, installation support and a usual lead time of 2 to 3 months.":"Доставка «под ключ», поддержка при установке и обычное время выполнения заказа от 2 до 3 месяцев.","Two sizes and a clear price":"Два размера и понятная цена","The Big models need about 5.2 × 4.62 metres. The Mini models fit in about 2.4 × 2.8 metres, which is a classroom or a corner of a hangar. Both lines exist as a simpler version and as a professional version. Purchase prices for the full-embedded professional units start at about €65,000 to €70,000. The ATC simulator, built for tower, approach and multi-sector training, is a separate system and starts at about €350,000. Cockpit parts, including the Magic Yoke, Garmin-style panels, a radio, a transponder and a compass, can be bought on their own if you are building a device yourself.":"Для больших моделей требуется около 5,2 × 4,62 метра. Модели Mini умещаются размером примерно 2,4 × 2,8 метра, что соответствует классной комнате или углу ангара. Обе линейки существуют как более простая версия, так и профессиональная версия. Цены на полноценные профессиональные устройства начинаются от 65 000 до 70 000 евро. Тренажер УВД, созданный для обучения вышке, заходу на посадку и многосекторному обучению, представляет собой отдельную систему и стоит около 350 000 евро. Детали кабины, включая Magic Yoke, панели в стиле Garmin, радио, транспондер и компас, можно купить отдельно, если вы собираете устройство самостоятельно.","Who it is built for":"Для кого он создан","The main buyers are flight schools, aero clubs and training organisations that want more hours on the ground without losing the feel of a Cessna. Owners also use it as a private procedure trainer in a garage or a small hall. It runs in any weather, day or night, so the timetable does not stop for wind or for a grounded aircraft.":"Основными покупателями являются летные школы, аэроклубы и учебные организации, которые хотят проводить больше времени на земле, не теряя при этом ощущения Cessna. Владельцы также используют его как тренажер для частных процедур в гараже или небольшом зале. Он курсирует в любую погоду, днем ​​и ночью, поэтому расписание не прерывается из-за ветра или приземлившегося самолета.","We check the room, the power supply and the access path before the order. The unit is tested and then delivered. After installation we stay available for maintenance and remote support. If you already know the room size, write to info@virtualsky.gr with the model you prefer and the country of delivery.":"Перед заказом мы проверяем помещение, электроснабжение и путь доступа. Устройство тестируется и затем доставляется. После установки мы остаемся доступными для обслуживания и удаленной поддержки. Если вы уже знаете размер комнаты, напишите на почту info@virtualsky.gr, указав предпочитаемую модель и страну доставки.","What the simulator replaces, and what it does not":"Что симулятор заменяет, а что нет","Simulator time does not replace every hour required by the regulations. It does remove a large part of the cost and the risk from the early lessons. Work associated with the University of Illinois reports about 40 percent fewer errors in the first real flight hours after structured simulator training. European and US authorities both treat a flight simulation training device as a normal tool for pilot training, not as a toy. Use the official pages when you design a syllabus:":"Время симулятора не заменяет каждый час, предусмотренный регламентом. Это действительно устраняет большую часть затрат и рисков на первых уроках. Исследования, проведенные в Университете Иллинойса, показывают, что ошибок в первые часы реального полета после структурированного обучения на симуляторе становится примерно на 40 процентов меньше. Власти Европы и США относятся к тренажеру-симулятору полета как к обычному инструменту обучения пилотов, а не как к игрушке. Используйте официальные страницы при разработке учебной программы:","EASA: Flight Simulation Training Devices":"EASA: Учебные устройства для моделирования полета","FAA: National Simulator Program":"ФАУ: Национальная программа моделирования","A quotation includes the chosen model, shipping to your country, installation and the first training for your instructors. You do not have to buy the parts separately: the full-embedded simulator is delivered as one machine.":"В предложение входит выбранная модель, доставка в вашу страну, установка и первое обучение ваших инструкторов. Вам не придется покупать детали отдельно: полноценный симулятор поставляется как одна машина.","Tell us the model, the room and the number of students. We reply with a formal offer, the delivery window and what has to be ready on site.":"Сообщите нам модель, комнату и количество студентов. Мы отвечаем официальным предложением, сроком поставки и тем, что должно быть готово на месте."},"de":{"A flight school simulator, not a computer game":"Ein Flugschulsimulator, kein Computerspiel","The machines on this site are professional Cessna 172 and Cessna 152 training devices for flight schools and aero clubs. They are not the PC game that uses a similar name. The student sits in a full-size cabin, holds a real yoke and looks at a wide visual system. The instructor starts the session from an iPad or iPhone. There is no separate desktop computer to boot and no external controller box to configure.":"Bei den Maschinen auf dieser Seite handelt es sich um professionelle Cessna 172- und Cessna 152-Trainingsgeräte für Flugschulen und Aeroclubs. Es handelt sich nicht um das PC-Spiel, das einen ähnlichen Namen verwendet. Der Student sitzt in einer vollwertigen Kabine, hält ein echtes Joch und blickt auf ein weites visuelles System. Der Kursleiter startet die Sitzung über ein iPad oder iPhone. Es muss kein separater Desktop-Computer gestartet und keine externe Controller-Box konfiguriert werden.","A school uses the simulator for procedures, cockpit familiarisation, radio work and the first hours of handling, before the student burns fuel in the aircraft. The operating cost is about €3 per hour. There is no fuel, no engine time and no airframe wear. Schools that move a large share of early training into the simulator commonly save 30 to 92 percent against flying the same exercises in the real Cessna.":"Eine Schule nutzt den Simulator für Abläufe, Einarbeitung in das Cockpit, Funkarbeiten und die ersten Stunden der Handhabung, bevor der Schüler im Flugzeug Treibstoff verbrennt. Die Betriebskosten betragen ca. 3 € pro Stunde. Es gibt keinen Treibstoff, keine Triebwerkslaufzeit und keinen Flugzeugzellenverschleiß. Schulen, die einen großen Teil der frühen Ausbildung in den Simulator verlagern, sparen in der Regel 30 bis 92 Prozent gegenüber dem Fliegen derselben Übungen in der echten Cessna.","What is included":"Was ist enthalten","A full-size Cessna 172 or 152 cabin, in Big or Mini size.":"Eine vollwertige Kabine der Cessna 172 oder 152, in Big- oder Mini-Größe.","Fully automatic start: ready to fly in about 65 seconds.":"Vollautomatischer Start: Flugbereit in ca. 65 Sekunden.","Control from an iPad or iPhone, with no external controller.":"Steuerung über ein iPad oder iPhone, ohne externen Controller.","Real primer, carburettor heat and fuses, not painted switches.":"Echte Grundierung, Vergaserheizung und Sicherungen, nicht lackierte Schalter.","A visual system sized for the model you choose.":"Ein visuelles System, das auf das von Ihnen gewählte Modell zugeschnitten ist.","Turnkey delivery, installation support and a usual lead time of 2 to 3 months.":"Schlüsselfertige Lieferung, Installationsunterstützung und eine übliche Vorlaufzeit von 2 bis 3 Monaten.","Two sizes and a clear price":"Zwei Größen und ein klarer Preis","The Big models need about 5.2 × 4.62 metres. The Mini models fit in about 2.4 × 2.8 metres, which is a classroom or a corner of a hangar. Both lines exist as a simpler version and as a professional version. Purchase prices for the full-embedded professional units start at about €65,000 to €70,000. The ATC simulator, built for tower, approach and multi-sector training, is a separate system and starts at about €350,000. Cockpit parts, including the Magic Yoke, Garmin-style panels, a radio, a transponder and a compass, can be bought on their own if you are building a device yourself.":"Die Big-Modelle benötigen etwa 5,2 × 4,62 Meter. Die Mini-Modelle passen in etwa 2,4 × 2,8 Meter, was einem Klassenzimmer oder einer Ecke eines Hangars entspricht. Beide Linien existieren als einfachere Version und als professionelle Version. Die Kaufpreise für die vollintegrierten Profi-Geräte beginnen bei etwa 65.000 bis 70.000 Euro. Der ATC-Simulator, der für Tower-, Approach- und Multi-Sektor-Training gebaut wurde, ist ein separates System und kostet ab etwa 350.000 Euro. Cockpit-Teile, darunter das Magic Yoke, Panels im Garmin-Stil, ein Radio, ein Transponder und ein Kompass, können einzeln gekauft werden, wenn Sie ein Gerät selbst bauen.","Who it is built for":"Für wen es gebaut ist","The main buyers are flight schools, aero clubs and training organisations that want more hours on the ground without losing the feel of a Cessna. Owners also use it as a private procedure trainer in a garage or a small hall. It runs in any weather, day or night, so the timetable does not stop for wind or for a grounded aircraft.":"Die Hauptabnehmer sind Flugschulen, Aeroclubs und Ausbildungsorganisationen, die mehr Stunden am Boden verbringen möchten, ohne das Gefühl einer Cessna zu verlieren. Besitzer nutzen es auch als privaten Verfahrenstrainer in einer Garage oder einer kleinen Halle. Der Betrieb erfolgt bei jedem Wetter, Tag und Nacht, sodass der Fahrplan weder wegen Wind noch wegen eines am Boden liegenden Flugzeugs unterbrochen wird.","We check the room, the power supply and the access path before the order. The unit is tested and then delivered. After installation we stay available for maintenance and remote support. If you already know the room size, write to info@virtualsky.gr with the model you prefer and the country of delivery.":"Wir prüfen vor der Bestellung den Raum, die Stromversorgung und den Zufahrtsweg. Das Gerät wird getestet und dann ausgeliefert. Nach der Installation bleiben wir für Wartung und Fernunterstützung verfügbar. Wenn Sie die Raumgröße bereits kennen, schreiben Sie an info@virtualsky.gr mit dem von Ihnen bevorzugten Modell und dem Lieferland.","What the simulator replaces, and what it does not":"Was der Simulator ersetzt und was nicht","Simulator time does not replace every hour required by the regulations. It does remove a large part of the cost and the risk from the early lessons. Work associated with the University of Illinois reports about 40 percent fewer errors in the first real flight hours after structured simulator training. European and US authorities both treat a flight simulation training device as a normal tool for pilot training, not as a toy. Use the official pages when you design a syllabus:":"Die Simulatorzeit ersetzt nicht jede gesetzlich vorgeschriebene Stunde. Dadurch entfällt ein großer Teil der Kosten und des Risikos des frühen Unterrichts. Untersuchungen der University of Illinois berichten von etwa 40 Prozent weniger Fehlern in den ersten echten Flugstunden nach einem strukturierten Simulatortraining. Sowohl die europäischen als auch die US-amerikanischen Behörden betrachten ein Flugsimulationstrainingsgerät als normales Werkzeug für die Pilotenausbildung und nicht als Spielzeug. Nutzen Sie die offiziellen Seiten, wenn Sie einen Lehrplan entwerfen:","EASA: Flight Simulation Training Devices":"EASA: Flugsimulations-Trainingsgeräte","FAA: National Simulator Program":"FAA: Nationales Simulatorprogramm","A quotation includes the chosen model, shipping to your country, installation and the first training for your instructors. You do not have to buy the parts separately: the full-embedded simulator is delivered as one machine.":"Ein Angebot umfasst das ausgewählte Modell, den Versand in Ihr Land, die Installation und die erste Schulung Ihrer Ausbilder. Sie müssen die Teile nicht separat kaufen: Der voll integrierte Simulator wird als eine Maschine geliefert.","Tell us the model, the room and the number of students. We reply with a formal offer, the delivery window and what has to be ready on site.":"Teilen Sie uns das Modell, den Raum und die Anzahl der Studierenden mit. Wir antworten mit einem formellen Angebot, dem Lieferfenster und dem, was vor Ort bereit sein muss."},"it":{"A flight school simulator, not a computer game":"Un simulatore di scuola di volo, non un gioco per computer","The machines on this site are professional Cessna 172 and Cessna 152 training devices for flight schools and aero clubs. They are not the PC game that uses a similar name. The student sits in a full-size cabin, holds a real yoke and looks at a wide visual system. The instructor starts the session from an iPad or iPhone. There is no separate desktop computer to boot and no external controller box to configure.":"Le macchine presenti in questo sito sono dispositivi professionali da addestramento Cessna 172 e Cessna 152 per scuole di volo e aeroclub. Non sono il gioco per PC che utilizza un nome simile. Lo studente siede in una cabina a grandezza naturale, tiene in mano un vero giogo e guarda un ampio sistema visivo. L'istruttore avvia la sessione da un iPad o iPhone. Non è necessario avviare un computer desktop separato né un controller esterno da configurare.","A school uses the simulator for procedures, cockpit familiarisation, radio work and the first hours of handling, before the student burns fuel in the aircraft. The operating cost is about €3 per hour. There is no fuel, no engine time and no airframe wear. Schools that move a large share of early training into the simulator commonly save 30 to 92 percent against flying the same exercises in the real Cessna.":"Una scuola utilizza il simulatore per le procedure, per familiarizzare con la cabina di pilotaggio, per lavorare con la radio e per le prime ore di manovra, prima che lo studente consumi carburante nell'aereo. Il costo di esercizio è di circa 3€ l'ora. Non c'è carburante, non c'è tempo del motore e non c'è usura della cellula. Le scuole che trasferiscono gran parte della formazione iniziale nel simulatore risparmiano solitamente dal 30 al 92% rispetto al volo degli stessi esercizi sul vero Cessna.","What is included":"Cosa è incluso","A full-size Cessna 172 or 152 cabin, in Big or Mini size.":"Una cabina Cessna 172 o 152 a grandezza naturale, nelle dimensioni Big o Mini.","Fully automatic start: ready to fly in about 65 seconds.":"Avvio completamente automatico: pronto al volo in circa 65 secondi.","Control from an iPad or iPhone, with no external controller.":"Controllo da iPad o iPhone, senza controller esterno.","Real primer, carburettor heat and fuses, not painted switches.":"Vero primer, calore carburatore e fusibili, interruttori non verniciati.","A visual system sized for the model you choose.":"Un sistema visivo dimensionato per il modello che sceglierai.","Turnkey delivery, installation support and a usual lead time of 2 to 3 months.":"Consegna chiavi in mano, supporto per l'installazione e tempi di consegna abituali di 2 o 3 mesi.","Two sizes and a clear price":"Due taglie e un prezzo chiaro","The Big models need about 5.2 × 4.62 metres. The Mini models fit in about 2.4 × 2.8 metres, which is a classroom or a corner of a hangar. Both lines exist as a simpler version and as a professional version. Purchase prices for the full-embedded professional units start at about €65,000 to €70,000. The ATC simulator, built for tower, approach and multi-sector training, is a separate system and starts at about €350,000. Cockpit parts, including the Magic Yoke, Garmin-style panels, a radio, a transponder and a compass, can be bought on their own if you are building a device yourself.":"I modelli Big necessitano di circa 5,2×4,62 metri. I modelli Mini occupano circa 2,4 x 2,8 metri, ovvero un'aula o l'angolo di un hangar. Entrambe le linee esistono come versione più semplice e come versione professionale. I prezzi di acquisto per le unità professionali full-embedded partono da circa 65.000 € fino a 70.000 €. Il simulatore ATC, costruito per torre, avvicinamento e addestramento multisettoriale, è un sistema separato e parte da circa 350.000 euro. Le parti della cabina di pilotaggio, incluso il Magic Yoke, i pannelli in stile Garmin, una radio, un transponder e una bussola, possono essere acquistati da soli se costruisci tu stesso un dispositivo.","Who it is built for":"Per chi è costruito","The main buyers are flight schools, aero clubs and training organisations that want more hours on the ground without losing the feel of a Cessna. Owners also use it as a private procedure trainer in a garage or a small hall. It runs in any weather, day or night, so the timetable does not stop for wind or for a grounded aircraft.":"I principali acquirenti sono le scuole di volo, gli aeroclub e le organizzazioni di addestramento che desiderano più ore a terra senza perdere la sensazione di un Cessna. I proprietari lo utilizzano anche come trainer per procedure private in un garage o in una piccola sala. Funziona con qualsiasi tempo, giorno e notte, quindi l'orario non si ferma in caso di vento o di un aereo a terra.","We check the room, the power supply and the access path before the order. The unit is tested and then delivered. After installation we stay available for maintenance and remote support. If you already know the room size, write to info@virtualsky.gr with the model you prefer and the country of delivery.":"Prima dell'ordine controlliamo la stanza, l'alimentazione elettrica e il percorso di accesso. L'unità viene testata e poi consegnata. Dopo l'installazione restiamo a disposizione per manutenzione e supporto remoto. Se conosci già la dimensione della stanza, scrivi a info@virtualsky.gr indicando il modello che preferisci e il paese di consegna.","What the simulator replaces, and what it does not":"Cosa sostituisce il simulatore e cosa no","Simulator time does not replace every hour required by the regulations. It does remove a large part of the cost and the risk from the early lessons. Work associated with the University of Illinois reports about 40 percent fewer errors in the first real flight hours after structured simulator training. European and US authorities both treat a flight simulation training device as a normal tool for pilot training, not as a toy. Use the official pages when you design a syllabus:":"Il tempo del simulatore non sostituisce ogni ora prevista dalla normativa. Elimina gran parte dei costi e dei rischi dalle prime lezioni. Il lavoro associato all'Università dell'Illinois riporta circa il 40% in meno di errori nelle prime ore di volo reali dopo l'addestramento strutturato al simulatore. Sia le autorità europee che quelle statunitensi trattano un dispositivo di simulazione di volo come un normale strumento per l'addestramento dei piloti, non come un giocattolo. Utilizza le pagine ufficiali quando progetti un programma:","EASA: Flight Simulation Training Devices":"EASA: dispositivi di addestramento alla simulazione di volo","FAA: National Simulator Program":"FAA: programma nazionale di simulazione","A quotation includes the chosen model, shipping to your country, installation and the first training for your instructors. You do not have to buy the parts separately: the full-embedded simulator is delivered as one machine.":"Il preventivo comprende il modello scelto, la spedizione nel tuo paese, l'installazione e la prima formazione per i tuoi istruttori. Non è necessario acquistare le parti separatamente: il simulatore completamente integrato viene consegnato come un'unica macchina.","Tell us the model, the room and the number of students. We reply with a formal offer, the delivery window and what has to be ready on site.":"Raccontaci il modello, la stanza e il numero di studenti. Rispondiamo con un'offerta formale, la finestra di consegna e ciò che deve essere pronto in loco."},"el":{"A flight school simulator, not a computer game":"Ένας προσομοιωτής σχολής πτήσης, όχι ένα παιχνίδι υπολογιστή","The machines on this site are professional Cessna 172 and Cessna 152 training devices for flight schools and aero clubs. They are not the PC game that uses a similar name. The student sits in a full-size cabin, holds a real yoke and looks at a wide visual system. The instructor starts the session from an iPad or iPhone. There is no separate desktop computer to boot and no external controller box to configure.":"Τα μηχανήματα σε αυτόν τον ιστότοπο είναι επαγγελματικές συσκευές εκπαίδευσης Cessna 172 και Cessna 152 για σχολές πτήσεων και αερολέσχες. Δεν είναι το παιχνίδι για υπολογιστή που χρησιμοποιεί παρόμοιο όνομα. Ο μαθητής κάθεται σε μια καμπίνα πλήρους μεγέθους, κρατά έναν πραγματικό ζυγό και κοιτάζει ένα ευρύ οπτικό σύστημα. Ο εκπαιδευτής ξεκινά τη συνεδρία από ένα iPad ή iPhone. Δεν υπάρχει ξεχωριστός επιτραπέζιος υπολογιστής για εκκίνηση και κανένα εξωτερικό πλαίσιο ελεγκτή για διαμόρφωση.","A school uses the simulator for procedures, cockpit familiarisation, radio work and the first hours of handling, before the student burns fuel in the aircraft. The operating cost is about €3 per hour. There is no fuel, no engine time and no airframe wear. Schools that move a large share of early training into the simulator commonly save 30 to 92 percent against flying the same exercises in the real Cessna.":"Ένα σχολείο χρησιμοποιεί τον προσομοιωτή για διαδικασίες, εξοικείωση με το πιλοτήριο, ραδιοφωνική εργασία και τις πρώτες ώρες χειρισμού, πριν ο μαθητής κάψει καύσιμο στο αεροσκάφος. Το κόστος λειτουργίας είναι περίπου 3€ την ώρα. Δεν υπάρχει καύσιμο, χρόνος κινητήρα και φθορά του αεροπλάνου. Τα σχολεία που μεταφέρουν μεγάλο μερίδιο της πρώιμης προπόνησης στον προσομοιωτή συνήθως εξοικονομούν 30 έως 92 τοις εκατό από το να πετούν τις ίδιες ασκήσεις στο πραγματικό Cessna.","What is included":"Τι περιλαμβάνεται","A full-size Cessna 172 or 152 cabin, in Big or Mini size.":"Μια καμπίνα Cessna 172 ή 152 πλήρους μεγέθους, σε μέγεθος Big ή Mini.","Fully automatic start: ready to fly in about 65 seconds.":"Πλήρως αυτόματη εκκίνηση: έτοιμο να πετάξει σε περίπου 65 δευτερόλεπτα.","Control from an iPad or iPhone, with no external controller.":"Έλεγχος από iPad ή iPhone, χωρίς εξωτερικό χειριστήριο.","Real primer, carburettor heat and fuses, not painted switches.":"Πραγματικό αστάρι, θερμότητα καρμπυρατέρ και ασφάλειες, όχι βαμμένοι διακόπτες.","A visual system sized for the model you choose.":"Ένα οπτικό σύστημα με μέγεθος για το μοντέλο που επιλέγετε.","Turnkey delivery, installation support and a usual lead time of 2 to 3 months.":"Παράδοση με το κλειδί στο χέρι, υποστήριξη εγκατάστασης και συνήθης χρόνος παράδοσης από 2 έως 3 μήνες.","Two sizes and a clear price":"Δύο μεγέθη και ξεκάθαρη τιμή","The Big models need about 5.2 × 4.62 metres. The Mini models fit in about 2.4 × 2.8 metres, which is a classroom or a corner of a hangar. Both lines exist as a simpler version and as a professional version. Purchase prices for the full-embedded professional units start at about €65,000 to €70,000. The ATC simulator, built for tower, approach and multi-sector training, is a separate system and starts at about €350,000. Cockpit parts, including the Magic Yoke, Garmin-style panels, a radio, a transponder and a compass, can be bought on their own if you are building a device yourself.":"Τα μοντέλα Big χρειάζονται περίπου 5,2 × 4,62 μέτρα. Τα μοντέλα Mini ταιριάζουν σε περίπου 2,4 × 2,8 μέτρα, που είναι μια τάξη ή μια γωνία ενός υπόστεγου. Και οι δύο γραμμές υπάρχουν ως απλούστερη έκδοση και ως επαγγελματική έκδοση. Οι τιμές αγοράς για τις πλήρως ενσωματωμένες επαγγελματικές μονάδες ξεκινούν από περίπου 65.000€ έως 70.000€. Ο προσομοιωτής ATC, κατασκευασμένος για εκπαίδευση πύργου, προσέγγισης και πολλαπλών τομέων, είναι ένα ξεχωριστό σύστημα και ξεκινά από περίπου 350.000 €. Ανταλλακτικά πιλοτηρίου, συμπεριλαμβανομένων του Magic Yoke, των πάνελ τύπου Garmin, ενός ραδιοφώνου, ενός αναμεταδότη και μιας πυξίδας, μπορούν να αγοραστούν μόνα τους εάν κατασκευάζετε μια συσκευή μόνοι σας.","Who it is built for":"Για ποιους είναι φτιαγμένο","The main buyers are flight schools, aero clubs and training organisations that want more hours on the ground without losing the feel of a Cessna. Owners also use it as a private procedure trainer in a garage or a small hall. It runs in any weather, day or night, so the timetable does not stop for wind or for a grounded aircraft.":"Οι κύριοι αγοραστές είναι σχολές πτήσεων, αερολέσχες και εκπαιδευτικοί οργανισμοί που θέλουν περισσότερες ώρες στο έδαφος χωρίς να χάσουν την αίσθηση ενός Cessna. Οι ιδιοκτήτες το χρησιμοποιούν επίσης ως εκπαιδευτή ιδιωτικών διαδικασιών σε ένα γκαράζ ή μια μικρή αίθουσα. Λειτουργεί με οποιονδήποτε καιρό, μέρα ή νύχτα, οπότε το χρονοδιάγραμμα δεν σταματά για άνεμο ή για προσγειωμένο αεροσκάφος.","We check the room, the power supply and the access path before the order. The unit is tested and then delivered. After installation we stay available for maintenance and remote support. If you already know the room size, write to info@virtualsky.gr with the model you prefer and the country of delivery.":"Ελέγχουμε το δωμάτιο, την παροχή ρεύματος και τη διαδρομή πρόσβασης πριν την παραγγελία. Η μονάδα δοκιμάζεται και στη συνέχεια παραδίδεται. Μετά την εγκατάσταση παραμένουμε διαθέσιμοι για συντήρηση και απομακρυσμένη υποστήριξη. Εάν γνωρίζετε ήδη το μέγεθος του δωματίου, γράψτε στο info@virtualsky.gr με το μοντέλο που προτιμάτε και τη χώρα παράδοσης.","What the simulator replaces, and what it does not":"Τι αντικαθιστά ο προσομοιωτής και τι όχι","Simulator time does not replace every hour required by the regulations. It does remove a large part of the cost and the risk from the early lessons. Work associated with the University of Illinois reports about 40 percent fewer errors in the first real flight hours after structured simulator training. European and US authorities both treat a flight simulation training device as a normal tool for pilot training, not as a toy. Use the official pages when you design a syllabus:":"Ο χρόνος προσομοιωτή δεν αντικαθιστά κάθε ώρα που απαιτείται από τους κανονισμούς. Αφαιρεί ένα μεγάλο μέρος του κόστους και του κινδύνου από τα πρώτα μαθήματα. Η εργασία που σχετίζεται με το Πανεπιστήμιο του Ιλινόις αναφέρει περίπου 40 τοις εκατό λιγότερα σφάλματα στις πρώτες πραγματικές ώρες πτήσης μετά την εκπαίδευση δομημένου προσομοιωτή. Οι ευρωπαϊκές και οι αμερικανικές αρχές αντιμετωπίζουν μια συσκευή εκπαίδευσης προσομοίωσης πτήσης ως κανονικό εργαλείο για την εκπαίδευση πιλότων, όχι ως παιχνίδι. Χρησιμοποιήστε τις επίσημες σελίδες όταν σχεδιάζετε ένα αναλυτικό πρόγραμμα:","EASA: Flight Simulation Training Devices":"EASA: Συσκευές εκπαίδευσης προσομοίωσης πτήσης","FAA: National Simulator Program":"FAA: Εθνικό Πρόγραμμα Προσομοιωτή","A quotation includes the chosen model, shipping to your country, installation and the first training for your instructors. You do not have to buy the parts separately: the full-embedded simulator is delivered as one machine.":"Η προσφορά περιλαμβάνει το επιλεγμένο μοντέλο, αποστολή στη χώρα σας, εγκατάσταση και την πρώτη εκπαίδευση για τους εκπαιδευτές σας. Δεν χρειάζεται να αγοράσετε τα εξαρτήματα ξεχωριστά: ο πλήρως ενσωματωμένος προσομοιωτής παραδίδεται ως ένα μηχάνημα.","Tell us the model, the room and the number of students. We reply with a formal offer, the delivery window and what has to be ready on site.":"Πείτε μας το μοντέλο, την αίθουσα και τον αριθμό των μαθητών. Απαντάμε με μια επίσημη προσφορά, το παράθυρο παράδοσης και τι πρέπει να είναι έτοιμο επί τόπου."}};
